<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care Team about <em><strong>&lt;enter issue here&gt;</strong></em>.
<p><em><strong>If policy applied correctly add</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Oneworld Policies</strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that you were unaware of the <strong><em>&lt;enter policy&gt;</em></strong> Oneworld policy and were unhappy with the <strong><em>charge/outcome</em></strong>. I understand you must be frustrated.<br />
<br />
I’ve looked into this and can confirm <em><strong>the fee was applied correctly/our staff advised you correctly</strong></em>, so we are unable to meet your request for a <strong><em>refund/compensation</em></strong>&nbsp;on this occasion.<br />
<br />
We provide information about our <strong><em>baggage/check-in/fees etc&nbsp;</em></strong>policy on our website at <strong><em>insert hyperlink to relevant page of qantas.com</em></strong><br />
<br />
<em><strong>If referring to Oneworld airline add</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Contact the airline directly</strong><br />
<br />
We want all our customers to have a smooth and enjoyable journey, so I was sorry to hear about your experience with our Oneworld partner, {{{Case.Airline__c}}}.<br />
<br />
As your flight was operated by {{{Case.Airline__c}}} you’ll need to contact them directly to discuss your experience. They can be contacted at <em><strong>insert airline email or feedback form address</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
